| makeresults count=90
``` Source de DEMONSTRATION : aucun index requis. Genere des evenements realistes
    sur la fenetre de la recherche planifiee (addinfo), avec des heures creuses,
    des pics et des rafales. IP : plages reservees a la documentation (RFC 5737). ```
| addinfo
| eval debut = if(info_min_time > 0, info_min_time, relative_time(now(), "-7m@m"))
| eval _time = debut + (random() % 300000) / 1000
``` volume : creux la nuit, un pic toutes les ~85 min ```
| eval h = tonumber(strftime(_time, "%H")),
       jour = 0.25 + 0.75 * abs(sin((h - 3) * pi() / 20)),
       pic = if(floor(debut / 300) % 17 == 0, 1, 0),
       garde = if(pic == 1, 100, round(40 * jour))
| where random() % 100 < garde
``` origine : 100 lignes ponderees par pays ; peu d'adresses par pays -> rafales ```
| eval k = random() % 100
| lookup wall_demo_origins k OUTPUT Country, src_lat, src_lon, net, base
| eval src_ip = net . "." . (base + random() % 8)
| eval source = "idp", s = if(pic == 1, 3, random() % 6)
| lookup wall_demo_signatures source, s OUTPUT signature, severity
| eval r = random() % 100
| eval dc = "CLOUD",
       dest_host = mvindex(split("example.org,partenaires.example.org", ","), random() % 2),
       action = "blocked"
| fields _time, src_ip, Country, src_lat, src_lon, dc, severity, signature, dest_host, action
